+## Four independent verdicts
 
-Do not add:
+| Record | Required evidence |
+| --- | --- |
+| Technical behavior | Scene launches and repeats required movement/turns with correct depth/alpha and no relevant runtime errors |
+| Visual quality | Real motion at gameplay scale compared directly with the selected reference; named defects and assessment |
+| Production repeatability | Editable source → export → import → relaunch reproduced with recorded settings |
+| Owner feedback | Exact response to this revision; pending until received, never inferred from technical passes |
 
-- trade-ins
