+Current user direction governs. This master plan is the repository production authority; the Desktop next-steps file is its synchronized handoff. Active supporting documents are the recovery review, art direction, tiny visual proof specification, visual task list, current milestones, source policy, and local validation plan. Decision 0005 records the restart.
 
